#: includes/class-sr-admin.php
msgid "Swarm Rebuild"
msgstr "Swarm Rebuild"

#: includes/class-sr-admin.php
msgid "Swarm Rebuild Settings"
msgstr "Swarm Rebuild 设置"

msgid ""
"The rebuild plays automatically on every visit to pages in scope — finished "
"elements become clickable while the swarm is still building. Visitors who "
"dismissed the animation (Esc or the card) keep that choice in their browser."
msgstr ""
"重建动画会在范围内页面每次访问时自动播放——构建过程中,绘制完成的元素即可点击。访客按 "
"Esc 或用卡片关闭过动画的选择会在其浏览器中保留。"

msgid "Where to enable"
msgstr "生效范围"

msgid "Front page only"
msgstr "仅首页"

msgid "Specific URLs"
msgstr "指定 URL"

msgid "Entire site"
msgstr "整站"

msgid ""
"One path per line (e.g. about or pricing). Used when \"Specific URLs\" is "
"selected."
msgstr "每行一个路径(如 about 或 pricing),仅在范围选择“指定 URL”时使用。"

msgid "Return to the live page when finished"
msgstr "结束后自动回到真实页面"

msgid ""
"The rebuild plays on every visit; finished links are clickable while it "
"builds. When on, the page fades back to the live site a moment after the "
"rebuild completes. When off, the rebuilt page stays until the visitor clicks "
"a link or exits."
msgstr ""
"重建动画每次访问都会播放;构建过程中已完成的链接即可点击。开启时,重建完成片刻后页面淡回真实站点;关闭时,重建页将保留,直到访客点击链接或退出。"

msgid "Sound on by default"
msgstr "默认开启声音"

msgid "Visitors can mute on the card; the choice sticks in their browser."
msgstr "访客可在悬浮卡片上静音,该选择在其浏览器中保留。"

msgid "Enable on mobile"
msgstr "在移动端启用"

msgid "Off by default: touch devices have no cursor metaphor."
msgstr "默认关闭:触屏设备没有光标隐喻。"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

#: includes/class-sr-frontend.php
msgid "Scanning page…"
msgstr "正在扫描页面…"

msgid "<b>%d</b> agents ready"
msgstr "<b>%d</b> 位光标就绪"

msgid "Rebuilt by <b>%d</b> agents in <b>%d</b>s"
msgstr "<b>%d</b> 位光标用时 <b>%d</b> 秒重建完成"

msgid "%d × %d"
msgstr "%d × %d"

msgid "scroll to keep building"
msgstr "滚动以继续构建"

msgid "Replay"
msgstr "重放"

msgid "Close animation"
msgstr "关闭动画"

msgid "Sound"
msgstr "声音"

msgid "Applies immediately; press M during the animation as well."
msgstr "立即生效;动画中也可按 M 键切换。"

msgid "Tour"
msgstr "巡览"

msgid "Touring"
msgstr "巡览中"

msgid "Auto-scroll while the swarm builds"
msgstr "随群体构建自动滚动"

msgid "Hide"
msgstr "收起"

msgid "Show"
msgstr "展开"
